A||||3||ferrari328||Problems with 4 SPD tranny||||5||
Z||000000||ferrari328||10-09-2000||06:11 PM||||Hi guys .. I hope you can help.  I have an 84 Fiero with a 4 SPD tranny.  The clutch and release bearing were changed 2 weeks ago.  Here is the problem : When the car is off I can put it in all 4 spds and reverse without any problems.  But after I start the car I can't put it in any speed besides reverse (it makes a noise when puting it into reverse), I have to stop the car, put it in first and than start the car in order for it to work.  When it comes to switching into 2nd, I can barrely take it out of first but there is no way I can put it back into any gear.  In order to put it into first again, I have to stop, and turn the engine off.  Than the shifter goes easily again into any gear but once the engine is running... forget about it.  Please help.<P>PS.  There is a V8 inside the car<P>Julian||||reg||5
Z||000001||2xsess||10-09-2000||07:15 PM||||Sounds like you have air in the hydraulic clutch system. Do a search on clutch problems and you'll learn all about it.<P>Good Luck<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
Z||000002||rockcrawl||10-09-2000||08:52 PM||||There is a V8 <B>inside</B> the car! Do you sit next to it? j/k<P>Sorry about that. It sure sounds like your clutch is not releasing.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT (awaiting new engine)<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<P>"Confidence is the feeling you have before you fully understand the situation"||||reg||1
Z||000003||2xsess||10-09-2000||10:15 PM||||Check out the Fiero factory's website, they have an article about clutch problems with a bunch of tips. If it's an 84 you probably have the aluminum pedal, I've been told it has a tendency to bend after 16 years of use. GM offers the new one in steel. The part number is on the website. <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html</A> <P>Hope it helps. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>85GT||||reg||1
